{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Ox1hSWnOBn1794811547.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>泰國布吉一幢四層高商業大樓起火，造成十一死、十六人傷。</p><p></p><p>火警發生在當地周一凌晨，一幢位於芭東海灘附近的商業樓宇，其中一個從事租車業務的單位有電單車先起火，火勢迅速蔓延至旁邊的建築物。火勢在大約兩小時後受控，起火原因有待調查，初步估計是附近有電纜短路起火所致。</p><p></p><p>警方指，大部分死者遺體都在四樓被發現，至於傷者幾乎全部是泰國公民，只有一人是緬甸籍，全部被送往醫院治療。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T07:34:29.275195+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":182,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T04:53:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T11:30:24.748754+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T07:27:44.927899+00:00","content_hash":"020142f36ff11a88220eb0f6568b980564fb11ee5aabcf872040c2b58bf15dc2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-16T07:34:29.275195+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}